    "detailed_description": "About game:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;weekdays&quot; is a psychological horror game with puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to a world of shadows and mysteries where every action you take matters. Your story begins in a strange room with a retro computer and floppy disks, each leading to a unique location filled with puzzles and enigmas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\nBlack-and-White Style: Immerse yourself in a unique atmosphere where light and shadow play a crucial role.<br />\r\nVariety of Locations: Explore strange corridors with rooms, a forest with a witch's hut, an old cemetery with a gloomy mausoleum, an abandoned house on a wasteland, and more.<br />\r\nEngaging Puzzles: Solve puzzles, each unique to its location, and delve deeper into the game world.<br />\r\nIncreasing Tension: With each step deeper, the game becomes more captivating and terrifying.",
